---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="NO BALL GAMES Research Vault | Brand Notes, Rights & Source Archive"
  description="Research vault for NO BALL GAMES brand notes, content rights, source material, archive planning and website development references."
  current="research"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Research vault</span>
    <h1>Archive the proof before building the myth.</h1>
    <p>
      This section is for research notes, content rights, source references, brand planning and the material that supports future pages.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section split-grid">
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">Current file</span>
      <h2>Content rights</h2>
      <p>
        Keep this area for documented source material and rights notes. It helps stop the website from turning into unsupported claims or copied content.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">Recommended research buckets</span>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li>Brand origin notes.</li>
        <li>Image ownership and usage rights.</li>
        <li>Press links and public references.</li>
        <li>Collection metadata and drop notes.</li>
        <li>Future article outlines and SEO targets.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
